  "ruleText": "Per 304.02 Director's Decision Pursuant to Per 303.04 and Per 304.01. If the appointing authority or the employee is not satisfied with the director's decision, the appointing authority or the employee may file an appeal with the board under RSA 273-D:3.\n\nSource. #8738, eff 10-18-06; ss by #10817, eff 5-17-15; ss by #13668, eff 6-23-23; ss by #14443, eff 12-1-25, EXPIRES 12-1-35",
